{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orthodox dungeon strategy RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore each dungeon and defeat bosses to proceed to the next dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u30fbThere are many challenging elements: collector items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u30fbHundreds of hidden items (tiny medal system)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u30fbStages with the same music for dungeon and battle appear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Treasure chests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are treasure chests that can be revived again by going back and forth in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a low probability of finding rare items in those treasure chests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of this game is a \u201cgame of matching answers\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, you need to put in a specific character to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't have the protection skill and weakness corresponding to the boss, you can't beat it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't beat it. (Exceptions).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch characters every time and put in the right skills for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to put in a character that has the right skills for the boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790220?t=1754782663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790220/3bee7caa24bd6946d5bdea2ff51acb266975d6c6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754782663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790220/edb985544cd6798e49db53ac1554f78149aa8cee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754782663","ca